      "message": "That\u0027s a good point. I added these optional flags:\n- the `--skip-install` flag skip reinstalling the app binary.\n- `--enable-features \u003cFEATURES\u003e` to pass Chromium experiment feature flags directly on launch \n- `--launch-arg \u003cARG\u003e` for passing arbitrary additional command line arguments to Chromium during launch.",
